00:03:06,660 --> 00:03:10,060
Especially when you talk about things that you mentioned here,

00:03:10,060 --> 00:03:13,540
it affects my brain, my eyesight, muscles, and all my joints,

00:03:14,580 --> 00:03:19,580
you start thinking of possibly a systemic autoimmune disease

00:03:20,220 --> 00:03:25,220
